## Appendix: Notes

- This report is a point-in-time read of cluster state.
- It combines health, upgrade, workload, security, and configuration signals.
- It prefers grouped summaries and top-N sections to reduce duplicate noise.
- If this report shows `CRITICAL`, start with operators, nodes, routes, warning event summaries, and firing alerts.

